BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:6446429@advancements.scouting.org
DTSTAMP:20260823T214103Z
CREATED:20250630T003257Z
ORGANIZER:Trevor Montgomery
DTSTART;TZID=America/Chicago:20251017T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Chicago:20251019T120000
SUMMARY:Monthly Campout: Fly Fishing Merit Badge
DESCRIPTION:Please eat BEFORE we leave for the campout; we will have a cracker barrel and campout instructions when we arrive\nFriday:&nbsp;\n\nArrive at LTMS at 6PM\nDepart LTMS by 6:30PM\n~45 minute drive to the park\nWe will be camping in the Group Camping Area (located on the map)\nPark Map:  https://tpwd.texas.gov/publications/pwdpubs/media/park_maps/pwd_mp_p4505_090d.pdf\n\nSaturday agenda:\n-	Breakfast: Patrol cooking\n-	Morning activity:  Fly fishing prioritizing those that are seeking the MB with Merrick Andersson of Sportsmans finest\n-	Lunch: Patrol cooking\n-	Afternoon activities:\n-	Continue fly fishing MB skills\n-	Fishing: see fishing tip sheet https://tpwd.texas.gov/publications/pwdpubs/media/pwd_lf_p4505_0090u.pdf\n-	Swimming (must be with at least two adults with Safe Swim Defense)\n-	Hiking:  see trail map https://tpwd.texas.gov/publications/pwdpubs/media/park_maps/pwd_mp_p4505_0090w.pdf\n-	SM Conferences and/or BORs\n-	Dinner: Patrol cooking\n-	Campfire program after dinner; will try to find a propane fire pit!!\nSunday:\n-	Cold breakfast\n-	Roses and Thorns and Buds\n-	Police lines\n-	Pack and depart for Lakeway\n-	Arrive home approximately 11:00 am\nSICs:&nbsp;\nTrevor Montgomery\ntrevmotngomery@yahoo.com\n512-663-4388\nSteve McKinney\nsamckinn@gmail.com\n512-203-2324\nGrubmaster: Dylan Van Meter &amp; Bryan Swan\nTrailers: Steve McKinney\nSmoker: N/A\n
URL:https://advancements.scouting.org/calendar/event/6446429
LOCATION:Location was not specified
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:6446437@advancements.scouting.org
DTSTAMP:20260823T214103Z
CREATED:20250630T004104Z
ORGANIZER:Tracy Bates
DTSTART;TZID=America/Chicago:20250924T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Chicago:20250924T203000
SUMMARY:Parent Meeting
DESCRIPTION:Please join us for a burger and your favorite refreshment at All-Star Burgers Hill Country Galleria to discuss the Troop 52 agenda with all of the parents and Leaders. We have seats on the patio.\n
URL:https://advancements.scouting.org/calendar/event/6446437
LOCATION:All-Star Burgers @ Hill Country Galleria - 12921 Hill Country Blvd #105\, Bee Cave\, TX 78738
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
