SUMMARY:CAC High Adventure Day
DESCRIPTION:CAC High Adventure Day\nONE OF THE BIGGEST RECRUITING EVENTS OF THE YEAR!\nWHO:    Your Crew\, Post\, Troop\, Ship\, any prospective Scouts and all friends that are 14 years and older\nWHAT:   Outdoor fun for your Crew\, Ship\, Post\, or Troop... and a great recruiting tool - bring all prospective members..\nWHEN:  Check in will start on Saturday\, September 13\, 2025 at 8:30AM and events run from 9:00AM until 4:00PM\nWHERE: Lost Pines Scout Reservation in Bastrop\, Texas\nREGISTRATION:   $30 per participant\, $10 per participating adult\, free non-participating adult (subject to change before event opens)\nEVENTS (subject to change):\nShooting Sports\nAM: Rifle\, Shotgun\, Slingshot\nPM: Cowboy Action Shooting  Pistol (waiver required) and Archery\nSwimming Pool\nClimbing\nOutdoor Games\nWHAT TO BRING:&nbsp;\nWater bottle\nSunscreen\nTowel\nLunch  not provided onsite\nREQUIRED: Annual Health and Medical Record (Parts A&amp;B): https://www.scouting.org/health-and-safety/ahmr/\nREQUIRED: Cowboy Action Shooting  Pistol Waiver - Click here to download\nREMINDERS: If wishing to camp overnight\, use the registration application to arrange that individually at https://www.bsacac.org/activities/camping/&nbsp;\n
URL:https://advancements.scouting.org/calendar/event/6462132
LOCATION:Lost Pines Scout Reservation
END:VEVENT
