SUMMARY:Tower Climbing Instructor Training
DESCRIPTION:One registration for both sessions.\nWould you like to enrich the program offered to your troop or crew?\nAttend this training course and learn how to run and facilitate a tower climbing experience at DOKS tower at Lost Pines Scout Reservation!\nThis course is a prerequisite to being able to taking the natural area climbing and COPE facilitator training course.  Campsites and some cabins are available for you to camp.  There is a Wednesday evening class from 7-9 on Sept 17th and then a weekend class that runs from Friday night to Sunday around noon Sept 19th-21st.   No previous climbing experience is required.&nbsp;\nThe fee for the class is $120.\n
URL:https://advancements.scouting.org/calendar/event/6462135
LOCATION:Council Service Center
END:VEVENT
