SUMMARY:Luke Bolich Eagle Project
DESCRIPTION:Troop 52!\nI respectfully ask for your support on my Eagle Project this coming Saturday September 27\, 8:00 to finish! We will be fixing up a sundeck at the retirement community in Lakeway. The Senior home is grateful for our support.\nCome for a couple of hours or all day. I appreciate any time you give.\nSincerely\, Luke Bolich\nWHAT: EAGLE PROJECT - LUKE BOLICH\nWHERE: Belmont Village Senior Living Lakeway 107 Bella Montagna Cir\, Lakeway\, TX 78734\nDATE: Saturday September 27\, 2025  8AM  Finish\nWHY: Community Service  Scout Service Hours\nPROJECT: Replace Repair and Paint hand railing and support of an Observation Deck at the Senior Home overlooking an observation pond.\nPlease join us for a great project. Anytime that you can afford is most appreciated.\nItems to bring: Work gloves\, Water bottle  Great attitude!\nWe will provide Doughnuts in the morning and Pizza for lunch.\nRSVP: tombolich@gmail.com - 703-629-8740\n
URL:https://advancements.scouting.org/calendar/event/6670568
LOCATION:Location was not specified
