SUMMARY:Fly Casting Clinic Austin Orr, Elevate Fly Casting
DESCRIPTION:Austin Orr from Elevate Fly Casting will host a clinic for Scouts and adults on the art of fly casting.\nIn this session\, we will practice the overhead cast and roll cast techniques.  We will supply all the gear and you are advised to bring clear glasses for protection if you have some.  We will have a few available otherwise.\nWe will prioritize the training of the Scouts working on the Fly Fishing Merit badge.  Each Scout will have the opportunity to complete requirement 5: \nDemonstrate the ability to cast a fly 30 feet consistently and accurately using both overhead and roll cast techniques.\n\nI need 3-4 adult volunteers to help manage the session with Mr. Orr.\n
URL:https://advancements.scouting.org/calendar/event/6682665
LOCATION:Lakeway Church
END:VEVENT
