SUMMARY:Declan Bolich Eagle Project
DESCRIPTION:I respectfully ask for your support on my Eagle Project on Saturday November 8 at 8:00 to finish! We will be building a signboard/kiosk at Creek Row Farm in Spicewood. The Farm is grateful for our support. Lets pay it forward! We will have doughnuts and pizza to keep you going.\nCome for a couple of hours or all day. I appreciate any time you give.\nSincerely\, Declan Bolich\nWHAT: EAGLE PROJECT - DECLAN BOLICH\nWHERE: Creekrow Farm\, 3700 R O Dr Spicewood\, TX 78669\nDATE: Saturday November 8\, 2025  8AM  3PM\nWHY: Community Service  Scout Service Hours\nPROJECT: We will be building a kiosk/signboard visible from the road including a lighting element.\nPlease join us for a great project. Anytime that you can afford is most appreciated.\nItems to bring: Work gloves\, Water bottle  Great attitude!\nWe will provide Doughnuts in the morning and Pizza for lunch.\nRSVP: tombolich@gmail.com - 703-629-8740\n
