SUMMARY:TTFC:  Totin' Chip
DESCRIPTION:We will hold a special session of Trail to First Class on April 18 from 10-12 for those Scouts looking to earn their Totin' Chip award. This certification grants a Scout the right to carry and use woods tools including pocket knives. If you Scout is going to summer camp this year and wants to purchase a knife in the Scout shop there\, he will need to have earned this award and have his Totin' Chip card on him for verification.We will setup three stations - one each for knife\, ax and saw use and safety.Please where closed toed shoes.For more information https://www.scouting.org/awards/awards-central/totin-chip/
