SUMMARY:Leadership Election
DESCRIPTION:The Troop 52 LeadershipElectionsThe Troop 52 Leadership Elections will be conducted through a surveyto select our Senior Patrol Leader (SPL) and Patrol Leaders. Thenames on the list are based on your previous leadership request survey\,with preference given to the first-ranked selection and then to thesecond and third options if no first option was requested for thatposition. There will only be one choice if only one candidate applied.Below is an explanation of the process:1.Â Senior Patrol Leader Election: You will make one selectionfrom the list of candidates to elect the Senior Patrol Leader.This is a troop-wide vote\, and every Scout gets one vote for thisposition.Patrol Leader Election: After selecting the SPL\, you willindicate your Patrol in the survey. You will then choose onecandidate from your Patrol to serve as Patrol Leader.Please complete the survey carefully\, as you will only have oneopportunity to submit your selections. Your votes are important inshaping our troops leadership for the next term!Good Luck!Mr. Bates\, ScoutmasterSurvey Link:Â https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSd1P-Hivxr0UPEMEr6ai9vZJJK7RueT26LPiohuYiyZiKqV7A/viewform?usp=publish-editor
