SUMMARY:Swim Test
DESCRIPTION:Hello Troop 52\,You must pass a valid swim test if you plan to attend Sea Base\, or other aquatic events like the canoeing campout. Swim tests are valid for one year and must be retaken.The Swim Test will be administered at Nitro Swimming in Bee Cave on May 16 atÂ 1PM.Nitro requires every participant to complete a liability waiver\, so I will need you to complete the online waiver. They have a strict policy about waivers. Please complete the waiver by May 11.https://waiver.smartwaiver.com/e/qqyYF3XAFo57GYsXVvTAyh/Nitro is donating their swimming lanes to our Troop\, and we need to take care of the lifeguard on duty. It has been customary for each participant to tip the lifeguard $5. Swim TestÂ Nitro Swimming
